{"title":"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A quadratic equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/c/63c9fdd34ac64eea1ec596431071516dfb8f031a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax^2 - 2ax + b = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"141\" height=\"16\" /> has two real solutions. What is the average of these two solutions?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/4/014aa6b6cfb3fdc9cb26bee8387b2711eb566ec0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 1\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ 2\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ \\frac ba\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ \\frac{2b}a\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ \\sqrt{2b-a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"414\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Dividing both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/a/7ea69a622cafec945bb193d6699af24a7b98e0cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 - 2x + b/a = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"141\" height=\"19\" />. By Vieta's formulas, the sum of the roots is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, therefore their average is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/0/dc0865c786265077a50821f95d649e65b7118da8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\Rightarrow \\boxed{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"62\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We know that for an equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/6/0561d206b22c2c257323a06ef53126f4e994d486.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax^2 + bx + c = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"130\" height=\"16\" />, the sum of the roots is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/6/3c6ab647b465ee283403c5992e8071b6621e40a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-b}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"24\" height=\"37\" />. This means that the sum of the roots for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/c/63c9fdd34ac64eea1ec596431071516dfb8f031a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax^2 - 2ax + b = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"141\" height=\"16\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/8/f78710be300c3ed7d75c87f7f89410b433e1a634.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2a}{a}=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"55\" height=\"37\" />. The average is the sum of the two roots divided by two, so the average is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/6/176e26d640779c679bd39a8d24aec30244da57c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac22 = 1 \\Rightarrow \\boxed{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"100\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the quadratic formula(assuming <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/502e059d1a020b368aee3a99c5669d88331d321f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />),we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/b/5bb60eea792cc1749b9165e9b9ac96befeb3fa4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{2 \\pm \\sqrt{4-4b}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"135\" height=\"43\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/d/a7d75b3cd740b3ff527bbb7efcb1673f7b7d3e41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\sqrt{4-4b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"99\" height=\"22\" />. Simplifying, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/1/771990f0d6262864976c70e0d4d7d4367803b402.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\pm \\frac{y}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"47\" height=\"34\" />. That means the sum of the solutions is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/5/46540654f84e4234791b4252dc872af513946841.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1+\\frac{y}{2}) + (1-\\frac{y}{2}) = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"175\" height=\"34\" />, so the average is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/0/d6038490c65b41deafc9d6491e22238f52262ae3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2/2 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A) } 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"109\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~idk12345678\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B\">2008 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_25\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_10_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 10 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 10 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class